  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study of the territorial impact of climate change on loss and damage related to migration and human mobility phenomena</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. The impact of climate change in terms of loss and damage related to migration and human mobility at national and subnational levels, identified and assessed, as an input for decision making in terms of adaptation to climate change.

2. Information on the territorial impact of human mobility and migration phenomena due to climate change and natural disasters produced</narrative>
  </description>
